OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court after death
OL,4,Aof woman last year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 41-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with the death of
OL,8,Fa woman in County Antrim.
OL,10,FMary McAdorey was found in a house in
OL,11,Fthe Old Mill Drive area of Newtownabbey
OL,12,Fon 12 October 2025.
OL,14,FGeorge Paul Connor McWilliams, of no
OL,15,Ffixed abode, has been charged with
OL,16,Fseveral offences including non-fatal
OL,17,Fstrangulation, domestic abuse and
OL,18,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
