OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court after death
OL,4,Aof woman last year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer told Belfast
OL,7,FMagistrates Court on Wednesday that
OL,8,FMcWilliams was Ms McAdorey's partner
OL,9,Fwhen she died.
